WEBVTT

00:01.670 --> 00:05.080
The Empire long dreamed of 
unifying this peninsula.

00:05.770 --> 00:07.960
Though we acted for future peace,

00:07.960 --> 00:10.370
we cannot deny that we bloodied our hands.

00:11.530 --> 00:14.660
So don't look like that, dear friend.

00:15.070 --> 00:17.870
You did not kill us of your own will.

00:23.020 --> 00:27.330
Corpse God, or rather, Rizdilusia Redrazalf.

00:29.360 --> 00:32.810
I finally outwitted the "Wandering Balcony."

00:33.420 --> 00:38.680
The deadly poison masked a curse 
with which I bound your name.

00:39.060 --> 00:43.140
Now, allow me to rewrite your destiny.

00:55.890 --> 01:00.050
Now, shall we start by hiding 
the conclusive proof?

01:01.430 --> 01:07.290
Testimony from a shade under a necromancer's 
control makes a poor defense.

01:08.680 --> 01:11.650
To think that we would end 
up shielding our own killer.

01:11.650 --> 01:14.010
This is what makes life so much fun!

01:14.010 --> 01:17.260
I suppose this makes us your accomplice!

01:17.590 --> 01:20.100
You killed us, your dear friend.

01:20.640 --> 01:24.310
We insist you atone with a long, long life.

01:30.310 --> 01:33.630
<i>We never meant our words 
to bind you, of course...</i>

01:34.550 --> 01:37.390
You're foolish as ever, dear friend.

01:38.860 --> 01:43.850
<i>Would you really kill yourself 
for someone else's sake again?</i>

03:16.730 --> 03:18.420
"The world's foe"!

03:18.420 --> 03:19.800
I love it!

03:19.800 --> 03:24.510
Although I can't fathom why you 
feel so attached to this world.

03:24.510 --> 03:26.890
And "return" your body?

03:27.470 --> 03:29.160
Oh, I see!

03:29.160 --> 03:32.440
As a necromancer, you're only possessing it!

03:32.440 --> 03:33.610
Correct.

03:35.180 --> 03:38.180
And I shall possess you next.

03:39.990 --> 03:41.240
Part of me

03:41.710 --> 03:47.160
resonated with his wish to live in peace.

03:47.410 --> 03:50.620
Seriously, how did things end up like this?

03:50.950 --> 03:52.120
Oh, crap!

03:52.120 --> 03:54.790
Why the hell did I end up feeling like this?!

03:55.040 --> 03:57.750
This isn't like me, damn it!

04:03.710 --> 04:05.050
<i>Hey! Polka!</i>

04:05.310 --> 04:05.970
Huh?

04:06.350 --> 04:09.310
<i>Stop looking down on us, asshole!</i>

04:09.800 --> 04:11.290
Kurupon?

04:11.290 --> 04:15.600
<i>What gives?! Who the hell asked you 
to start saying your goodbyes?!</i>

04:15.870 --> 04:18.610
<i>You "clash with this world"?!</i>

04:19.150 --> 04:22.780
<i>Sure, what you can do 
scares the pants off me!</i>

04:22.780 --> 04:25.860
<i>I figured I'd better steer clear of you!</i>

04:25.860 --> 04:26.990
<i>But so what?!</i>

04:26.990 --> 04:29.450
You and me

04:29.730 --> 04:30.910
and Misaki

04:30.910 --> 04:34.290
and the real Polka already get along fine!

04:34.290 --> 04:37.510
<i>And now you're just gonna up and leave?!</i>

04:37.510 --> 04:40.050
<i>You were the one who told me, remember?!</i>

04:40.460 --> 04:44.720
I've got no secrets worth 
more than a friend's life.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.510
So take your friends seriously!

04:47.510 --> 04:50.890
Plus, me and Misaki's job

04:50.890 --> 04:54.810
is helping mediate between 
you and this world!

04:57.440 --> 04:58.360
A blackout?!

04:58.860 --> 05:02.360
<i>I hijacked the power and all 
the cameras in that area!</i>

05:02.360 --> 05:05.900
<i>You shouldn't show up on any 
public footage for a while.</i>

05:05.900 --> 05:09.740
<i>Don't force yourself to play villain or hero.</i>

05:10.290 --> 05:14.160
Go all out your own way, Corpse God!

05:15.090 --> 05:16.620
Takumi-kun...

05:17.250 --> 05:18.710
Hmm?

05:18.710 --> 05:24.350
I get it now. The kids in 
that building chain you down.

05:24.350 --> 05:26.430
Then I'll start by—

05:26.940 --> 05:29.640
You'll start by doing <i>what</i>?

05:30.570 --> 05:32.720
You seem different again.

05:33.020 --> 05:34.620
Oh, right.

05:34.620 --> 05:36.940
I don't need to act villainous, do I?

05:37.870 --> 05:40.390
I know what you have in mind.

05:40.770 --> 05:42.730
So I'll say this again:

05:43.040 --> 05:45.030
I'll stop you.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.400
<i>Gems?</i>

05:46.810 --> 05:48.270
<i>Is he replenishing mana?</i>

05:48.630 --> 05:50.490
<i>But what is he doing with so many?!</i>

05:51.060 --> 05:52.480
For everyone—

05:52.990 --> 05:53.760
No.

05:54.960 --> 05:59.760
For a whim of mine: the peace of this city.

06:10.930 --> 06:14.140
<i>Where on earth did he 
get so many mana stones?</i>

06:14.140 --> 06:17.660
After all your talk, I guess you still used

06:17.660 --> 06:20.650
the wealth that belongs to 
that body—to Polka Shinoyama!

06:21.090 --> 06:24.190
This is money I earned,

06:24.190 --> 06:26.560
plus support from my cherished friends.

06:28.350 --> 06:32.700
That's right. For all my immaturity, 
people were willing to help me.

06:33.210 --> 06:34.620
In this world

06:35.120 --> 06:36.730
and in that one.

06:37.410 --> 06:40.250
Take your friends seriously!

06:40.850 --> 06:42.330
I guess he's right.

06:48.100 --> 06:51.550
Your "whim" is "the peace of this city"?

06:52.040 --> 06:54.010
That's already over.

06:54.280 --> 06:58.100
These are only some of the 
people my attacks just killed.

06:59.170 --> 07:05.290
You can take out the security cameras, 
but you can't pretend this never happened.

07:05.980 --> 07:08.570
Neither of us can!

07:09.850 --> 07:12.280
You've got one thing wrong.

07:12.800 --> 07:16.580
No one in this city has died yet today.

07:17.140 --> 07:19.370
My preparations made sure of that.

07:20.810 --> 07:22.230
<i>Don't tell me...?!</i>

07:22.620 --> 07:26.250
This city currently contains 
almost no living humans.

07:26.620 --> 07:29.470
It's already inside my Temple.

07:29.870 --> 07:32.230
<i>Everyone here is a shade?!</i>

07:32.230 --> 07:34.800
<i>Then... he even placed wards 
to keep people out?!</i>

07:34.800 --> 07:38.270
So right now, I don't need to hold back.

07:41.370 --> 07:42.270
Hm?

07:42.270 --> 07:43.710
What's going on?

07:43.710 --> 07:45.590
<i>Forgive me, sir.</i>

07:45.590 --> 07:48.110
I haven't managed to get close yet.

07:48.110 --> 07:49.530
I'm taking sniper fire.

07:49.830 --> 07:52.240
They seem focused on delaying m—

07:55.600 --> 07:58.200
This is all we can do.

07:58.570 --> 08:02.370
We'll provide you this city: Shinjuku.

08:02.970 --> 08:05.330
Now, do as you please.

08:06.370 --> 08:08.610
You and the bat are no different.

08:08.610 --> 08:11.270
Why don't you try to change this world?

08:11.270 --> 08:14.370
You're neglecting the power you've gained.

08:17.960 --> 08:19.890
In fact, you treat it with contempt!

08:19.890 --> 08:21.740
I wouldn't say that.

08:22.090 --> 08:25.850
Someone far, far more powerful 
and exceptional than me

08:26.680 --> 08:28.670
still wished for peace.

08:29.950 --> 08:35.290
An enemy necromancer controlled 
me and set me up as an assassin.

08:36.100 --> 08:38.810
I'm a hopeless fool of a corpse.

08:39.830 --> 08:43.370
But this mighty person still 
called me their dear friend.

08:46.730 --> 08:48.710
Who could you possibly mean?

08:49.040 --> 08:53.270
Didn't I tell you my cherished 
friends helped me out?

08:53.820 --> 08:58.050
Thanks to their support, 
I was able to ask for <i>his</i> aid.

09:02.250 --> 09:04.940
So, you've called on us at last.

09:05.840 --> 09:09.220
I'm sorry. It took a long time,

09:09.670 --> 09:12.940
but I found something I want 
to protect no matter what.

09:13.530 --> 09:17.150
Would Your Imperial Majesty assist me?

09:18.320 --> 09:19.370
No.

09:19.820 --> 09:21.700
Would you lend me a hand,

09:22.080 --> 09:23.050
dear friend?

09:27.940 --> 09:29.060
"Imperial Majesty"?!

09:29.570 --> 09:30.740
Don't tell me...

09:30.740 --> 09:35.150
that's Flamrodia Byandylaz, 
former Emperor of Byady?!

09:36.040 --> 09:37.200
Why?!

09:37.200 --> 09:40.920
I read the Corpse God was an 
arch-traitor who killed his emperor!

09:41.350 --> 09:42.930
So why is he here?!

09:43.420 --> 09:44.960
Why do they have a contract?!

09:46.730 --> 09:48.660
What did we tell you?

09:48.660 --> 09:55.210
Whatever you become, we and our 
empire will always stand by you.

09:55.900 --> 09:57.690
Necromancer!

09:58.350 --> 10:02.370
Do you expect me to believe you 
took in the whole fallen empire?!

10:03.660 --> 10:09.240
Don't make light of the Corpse God,
 our imperial court sorcerer!

10:14.240 --> 10:17.250
Still, ambient magic truly is scarce.

10:17.250 --> 10:20.090
Refining mana will take some time.

10:20.090 --> 10:23.440
Then I'd better buy you that time!

10:23.440 --> 10:27.520
I shall shelter the city's 
towers with my mystic thread.

10:27.520 --> 10:31.520
I believe another area demands my attention.

10:31.860 --> 10:33.400
Please take care of it.

10:35.530 --> 10:39.400
Today really is a dream come true!

10:42.180 --> 10:44.620
Even I must accept it!

10:44.840 --> 10:47.580
That's otherworldly power!

10:47.580 --> 10:52.180
And I haven't been able to shake 
a strange feeling for some time.

10:47.580 --> 10:54.670
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

10:52.180 --> 10:54.670
What do you think, Fire-Breathing Bug-kun?

10:54.670 --> 10:58.340
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

10:55.530 --> 10:58.340
Danger. Must burn.

10:58.650 --> 11:00.740
Before anything happens,

11:00.740 --> 11:03.350
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

11:01.110 --> 11:03.350
before tragedy strikes,

11:03.750 --> 11:08.560
we must burn it and this city.

11:09.430 --> 11:12.520
Would you please wait a moment?

11:14.530 --> 11:16.770
Young lady, how on earth...?

11:16.770 --> 11:22.170
Shouldn't you watch and judge 
whether he brings this world harm?

11:22.530 --> 11:24.780
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

11:22.900 --> 11:29.180
By what right, by what fate do you stop us?

11:29.530 --> 11:31.410
It is my business, if that's what you mean.

11:33.440 --> 11:36.000
You see, I was burned...

11:38.460 --> 11:42.810
by a fake bug who desperately admired you.

11:42.810 --> 11:45.930
And I owe <i>him</i> a debt.

11:46.510 --> 11:52.510
Could the strange sensation I've been 
feeling have brought her into being?

11:53.030 --> 11:55.450
Well, what do you say, 
Fire-Breathing Bug-kun?

11:58.680 --> 12:02.480
Sure, you may have a right to revenge.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.200
Boss!

12:06.160 --> 12:10.290
Still, protecting this city's our job.

12:10.290 --> 12:16.250
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

12:10.630 --> 12:16.250
And you include members of 
Sabaramond in this city?

12:16.250 --> 12:20.170
I include the ordinary citizens 
you're possessing right now!

12:20.760 --> 12:26.090
Even if you get your revenge, 
the blood on their hands won't disappear!

12:26.820 --> 12:31.890
You're screwing up their lives by 
making them stand here as we speak!

12:33.130 --> 12:36.020
I'll get your revenge a different way.

12:36.450 --> 12:40.190
At least, I'll find every 
Sabaramond scumbag in Japan,

12:40.450 --> 12:41.900
and crush 'em!

12:42.200 --> 12:46.070
So let those innocent people go.

12:46.070 --> 12:51.040
<b>Fire Safety</b>

12:46.460 --> 12:51.040
You expect us to simply 
trust you and disappear?

12:51.040 --> 12:52.680
I won't ask for that.

12:52.680 --> 12:56.120
If watching your revenge play 
out means so much to you,

12:57.090 --> 13:00.300
go ahead and copy your will onto me.

13:05.730 --> 13:07.800
Why would you go so far?

13:09.380 --> 13:10.890
Hmm... I wonder.

13:10.890 --> 13:14.770
Not to atone, and not 
to repay a debt, either.

13:16.350 --> 13:20.230
I can't put it into words, but I 
can just kind of tell, you know?

13:21.450 --> 13:26.700
I feel like giving up now would make 
who I've been since I met Polka a lie.

13:28.160 --> 13:30.510
So I'm gonna cut loose a little!

13:37.310 --> 13:40.790
You'll give back that shark plushie 
whether you like it or not!

13:43.630 --> 13:46.090
Could you be... a vampire?!

13:47.250 --> 13:48.640
What gave it away?

13:49.050 --> 13:50.450
What?!

13:55.670 --> 13:56.690
No!

14:02.940 --> 14:04.150
I'm getting nowhere!

14:04.150 --> 14:06.280
What the hell is your deal?!

14:06.280 --> 14:09.300
Are you that Lemmings guy, maybe?

14:10.540 --> 14:11.200
Well, then,

14:11.530 --> 14:15.200
I'm gonna step a little bit 
harder on the gas pedal.

14:17.870 --> 14:21.590
<i>How is this brat not freaking 
out over this form?!</i>

14:21.590 --> 14:22.970
I hate to break it to you,

14:22.970 --> 14:25.210
but I know someone just like you!

14:25.210 --> 14:28.680
In movement, breathing, and even spirit!

14:36.110 --> 14:37.980
I somehow managed to control—

14:38.730 --> 14:39.680
An earthquake?!

14:40.190 --> 14:41.390
<i>This is...</i>

14:41.900 --> 14:44.350
<i>Did the elemental take action?</i>

14:44.350 --> 14:46.730
<i>But I'll have to let someone else handle it.</i>

14:46.730 --> 14:47.860
<i>I have bigger problems.</i>

14:50.950 --> 14:57.080
He's refining his circles, growing 
closer to mastery with every touch.

14:57.080 --> 14:59.620
Who does that amateur think he is?

14:59.860 --> 15:02.920
He really must be a genius.

15:03.400 --> 15:08.410
But even then, how can he endure a court 
sorcerer's spells and remain standing?

15:08.410 --> 15:12.930
As a resident of this world, 
he shouldn't even be a sorcerer.

15:13.470 --> 15:17.600
This feeling... I've sensed 
it since I met him.

15:18.400 --> 15:19.660
It almost feels like...

15:20.080 --> 15:22.350
I'm facing Arius-san.

15:24.120 --> 15:27.480
<i>I don't want to risk my life 
for anyone but His Lordship.</i>

15:27.480 --> 15:29.460
<i>But if he wishes it,</i>

15:29.460 --> 15:32.520
<i>I'll work for the Shinoyamas.</i>

15:32.960 --> 15:37.060
<i>So keep your head in the clouds like always.</i>

15:37.060 --> 15:39.750
<i>Stay oblivious to my ugly jealousy</i>

15:40.160 --> 15:43.910
<i>and go on living at His Lordship's 
side with that dopey grin.</i>

15:44.750 --> 15:46.810
Trying to get Polka-kun back?

15:46.810 --> 15:50.930
Nope! Seems more like you're attacking me!

15:50.930 --> 15:54.050
So Polka-kun will be safer 
if I get him away from—

15:54.050 --> 15:55.500
Sakimiya-san!

15:56.290 --> 15:57.470
Xiaoyu-kun!

15:57.830 --> 15:59.930
Take the real Polka-kun!

16:03.940 --> 16:05.190
Sakimiya-san!

16:12.070 --> 16:13.280
Huh?

16:15.570 --> 16:16.890
Wow!

16:16.890 --> 16:19.270
It was only her body before.

16:19.270 --> 16:21.550
Can she seriously do things 
on that level now?!

16:27.360 --> 16:28.920
I got saved?

16:30.240 --> 16:33.290
Does that mean... someone's 
interfering in this fight?!

16:33.980 --> 16:35.840
Huh? We're falling?

16:38.100 --> 16:42.500
No wonder the elemental acts so wary.

16:42.500 --> 16:46.710
I never dreamed that monster 
had come to this world.

16:46.710 --> 16:48.570
Wh-Who are you?

16:52.850 --> 16:54.390
Dear me.

16:54.390 --> 16:59.840
Has even Elemental Speech perished 
in the century since I was killed?

16:59.840 --> 17:01.970
How depressing.

17:02.350 --> 17:07.710
Still, I'm glad I entrusted 
my soul to the Corpse God.

17:08.080 --> 17:11.450
I'd never have seen 
my descendant's face otherwise.

17:14.600 --> 17:17.390
I can't believe that boy 
found a dragon's arm.

17:18.010 --> 17:22.180
I wouldn't have sliced his 
prosthetic off if I'd known.

17:22.460 --> 17:24.640
Looks like the danger has passed.

17:25.370 --> 17:30.310
Thank you for explaining the danger 
approaching my brother after our fight.

17:31.190 --> 17:33.250
So I'll keep our pact.

17:34.150 --> 17:35.670
We have a truce

17:35.990 --> 17:39.390
until Xiaoyu chooses his path.

17:41.480 --> 17:44.810
I don't believe it. 
You stopped the elemental?

17:49.480 --> 17:51.720
And here I was getting the hang of things.

17:51.720 --> 17:55.250
If you came this far on your own,
 we're impressed.

17:55.250 --> 17:59.010
But losing to you like this 
wouldn't sit right with me.

17:59.240 --> 18:02.470
I'll go out doing everything in my power!

18:02.690 --> 18:03.870
That's...!

18:04.820 --> 18:07.190
<i>He's not just <i>like</i> Arius-san.</i>

18:07.190 --> 18:10.270
<i>He's using Arius-san's magic circle!</i>

18:11.630 --> 18:14.640
Not good! He'll blow the city 
sky high if we don't stop him!

18:15.600 --> 18:17.650
You haven't lost.

18:17.650 --> 18:21.200
In terms of raw power, you far exceed me.

18:22.040 --> 18:26.830
I merely borrowed—no, wielded power.

18:26.830 --> 18:29.050
I used everyone like tools.

18:29.890 --> 18:31.210
As you should.

18:31.450 --> 18:35.510
We and the rest are long dead,
 relics of the past.

18:35.860 --> 18:38.880
Use us till we break, and forge ahead.

18:39.380 --> 18:42.680
After all, you live in the here and now.

18:44.000 --> 18:46.610
I already died in the other world.

18:47.060 --> 18:49.640
The me here... is just a corpse.

18:50.140 --> 18:53.110
Living isn't about whether your body is dead.

18:53.540 --> 18:57.290
It's about whether you face forward.
 Right, Corpse God?

18:57.800 --> 18:58.570
No,

18:59.060 --> 18:59.900
Riz!

19:01.290 --> 19:04.190
In this world, follow your own will,

19:04.540 --> 19:06.870
and this time protect
 everything you want to!

19:07.530 --> 19:11.330
<i>Unlike me, you only ever looked far forward.</i>

19:12.180 --> 19:17.740
<i>Back then, I didn't understand how you 
could keep your gaze fixed straight ahead.</i>

19:18.380 --> 19:20.840
<i>But now, I think I have a vague idea.</i>

19:23.660 --> 19:26.640
This time, I'll drag <i>you</i> into <i>my</i> business.

19:28.770 --> 19:30.560
Make way.

19:31.560 --> 19:34.520
<i>What a beautiful magic circle.</i>

19:36.050 --> 19:40.490
<i>I feel like I did back then, 
when I first saw a spellbook.</i>

19:47.390 --> 19:48.870
So, this is the end.

19:49.670 --> 19:52.310
Still, I had fun.

19:57.650 --> 20:01.610
If watching your revenge play 
out means so much to you,

20:01.610 --> 20:04.510
go ahead and copy your will onto me.

20:04.510 --> 20:05.550
Iwa-san!

20:05.990 --> 20:08.490
Don't offer to take my place, any of you.

20:08.490 --> 20:11.810
I made this decision on my—

20:13.690 --> 20:14.730
Excuse me.

20:14.730 --> 20:15.310
Huh?

20:16.810 --> 20:18.080
Whoa.

20:18.080 --> 20:19.260
I kept my promise.

20:19.260 --> 20:23.260
You were got worked up again, 
so I stopped you with my fists.

20:23.260 --> 20:25.070
Y-You could hold back.

20:25.070 --> 20:26.280
I did.

20:26.280 --> 20:28.300
I know you, Iwa-san.

20:28.300 --> 20:31.020
You were thinking of 
Hosorogi-san, weren't you?

20:31.800 --> 20:33.450
Please don't forget.

20:34.120 --> 20:39.040
As far as we're concerned,
 you're part of the city we protect, too.

20:39.930 --> 20:41.300
Sorry.

20:41.670 --> 20:45.510
We respect your resolve.

20:45.510 --> 20:56.480
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

20:45.510 --> 20:56.480
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

20:46.250 --> 20:50.270
We will wait and see

20:50.270 --> 20:54.910
whether that boy is a bug.

20:54.910 --> 20:56.480
"That boy"?

20:56.730 --> 21:02.690
Whether we disappear
 for good depends on you.

21:03.650 --> 21:04.170
Huh?

21:04.170 --> 21:04.640
Where am I?

21:04.640 --> 21:05.170
Huh?

21:05.170 --> 21:05.700
What?

21:05.700 --> 21:08.660
<b>Fire
Safety</b>

21:06.650 --> 21:08.660
What am I doing here?

21:09.430 --> 21:10.790
Huh?! Solitaire?!

21:10.790 --> 21:12.700
No way! Can I have your autograph?!

21:12.910 --> 21:14.190
Indeed you may!

21:14.190 --> 21:16.620
I'm actually something 
of a celebrity, you know!

21:16.620 --> 21:19.930
Would you like one, too, ghostly young la—

21:20.490 --> 21:21.710
Oh?

21:26.260 --> 21:28.340
Am I dreaming?

21:28.920 --> 21:35.410
Come to think of it, those shitheads at 
the lab did say the heart they gave me

21:35.410 --> 21:39.330
was the core of a magic tiger with two heads.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.690
That tickles.

21:43.840 --> 21:44.990
I'm alive?

21:45.360 --> 21:49.510
You suffered serious wounds, 
but they didn't kill you outright.

21:50.340 --> 21:55.370
I patched you up with corpses, 
but living flesh should grow back in time.

21:56.030 --> 21:58.080
Why did you save me?

21:58.410 --> 22:00.410
You're a necromancer.

22:00.790 --> 22:04.100
You should have just 
killed and controlled me.

22:04.610 --> 22:08.090
You overpaid. I just gave 
you your change in magic.

22:09.010 --> 22:11.040
I gave you that...

22:11.040 --> 22:11.910
Besides...

22:11.910 --> 22:13.260
Civil-sama!

22:13.650 --> 22:18.940
I couldn't see or hear anything 
during that thunderous crash,

22:19.480 --> 22:21.400
but at that moment,

22:21.400 --> 22:24.930
I didn't want to make a child sad.

22:25.700 --> 22:29.430
I don't like taking things from children.

22:29.960 --> 22:32.180
You may regret it.

22:32.180 --> 22:33.270
Maybe.

22:33.600 --> 22:34.830
But when I do,

22:35.540 --> 22:38.030
I'll use all my power to protect 
everyone from the start.

22:40.330 --> 22:41.650
All right.

22:42.090 --> 22:45.510
I'll give up on returning 
to our world for now.

22:46.660 --> 22:50.340
I've learned this world 
is worth living in, too.

22:51.810 --> 22:53.550
Polka-kun!

22:53.550 --> 22:55.770
Civil-sama!

22:56.180 --> 22:59.210
On that, we agree.

23:15.180 --> 23:23.460
Surveillance Report

23:15.180 --> 23:23.460
Call Ended

23:15.180 --> 23:23.460
Sniping occurred on rooftop
Target: Polka Shinoyama
No visible injuries

23:16.170 --> 23:18.960
The people who want Polka Shinoyama dead

23:18.960 --> 23:23.080
seem to have linked up with intermediaries 
in Ikebukuro and Roppongi.

23:24.090 --> 23:29.170
Never forget, Corpse God-kun. 
And you, too, Polka-kun.

23:29.900 --> 23:37.330
Many more walls stand between 
you and the peace you seek.
